---
description: CI/CD pipelines must validate correctness, security and migration safety before deploy
globs:
  - ".github/workflows/**"
  - ".gitlab-ci.yml"
  - "**/*pipeline*"
---

- use least-privilege CI permissions
- never embed secrets
- keep validation/build/deploy concerns separated
- block production deploy on critical security or migration failures
- do not auto-run destructive migrations
